<BusinessAnalyticsLegalLayout title="Essential storage" description="The small amount of local storage used to keep core interface preferences." eyebrow="COOKIE DETAILS">
  <h2>What is essential?</h2><p>Essential storage supports the basic experience and prevents repeatedly resetting interface choices. In this demo it may remember theme selection, compact-table preference, reduced-motion preference and privacy choice. Imported CSV workspace contents are kept separately in IndexedDB on this device.</p>
  <h2>Where is it stored?</h2><p>These preferences use your browser's local storage on your device. They are not currently sent to a separate analytics service by this interface.</p>
  <h2>Can it be turned off?</h2><p>The application does not expose a switch for essential interface storage. You can remove saved values by clearing site data in your browser; some preferences may then return to their default state.</p>
  <h2>Related controls</h2><p>Visit <a href="/business-analytics/privacy-settings">Privacy settings</a> to review the current categories or return to the <a href="/business-analytics/cookies">Cookie policy</a>.</p>
</BusinessAnalyticsLegalLayout>
